 # CHANGELOG
 
+## v1.4 — 2026-08-21
+
+- Hotfix `LỌC ĐỒ TAY NẢI`: sparse/keyed managed bag collections no longer abort the full scan with `Managed exception ở object getter`.
+- Bag enumeration is now fail-soft: exact ordinal indexer fast-path -> managed enumerator (including `KeyValuePair.Value`) -> semantic `GetItemAtSite(Bag, position)` fallback.
+- Removed the unsafe blind fallback to an arbitrary one-argument `get_Item`, which could confuse dictionary keys with ordinal indexes.
+- Inventory KEEP / VỨT-HỦY / BÁN policy, AUTO full-bag ordering, Telegram label cleanup, protocol contract and unrelated AutoPK/travel/death logic remain unchanged.
+
 ## v1.3 — 2026-08-21
 
 - Thêm cửa sổ **Lọc đồ tay nải** đọc item semantic theo live instance.
